---
title: Zucchini Bread
source: Family recipe
---

Grease and flour a bake pan.

In a bowl, mix @eggs{3} with @oil or apple sauce{1%cup}.

Add @sugar{2%cups}, @flour{2%cups}, @baking powder{1/4%tsp}, @baking soda{2%tsp}, @nuts{1 cup}(chopped), @vanilla{2%tsp}, and @cinnamon{3%tsp}. 

Stir in @zucchini{2%cups}(grated).

Bake at 350°F for ~{1%hour}.

> A medium zucchini will provide about 2/3 cup of grated, tamped down zucchini. If your zucchini are very fresh, you may need to drain moisture from them, either by squeezing with a cheese cloth or adding some salt and letting sit for approximately 30 minutes. Otherwise, the moisture can throw off the ratios of the recipe.